---
import './memory.css';
import {phases,replay,policies} from './model.mjs';
const defaults=replay();
let offset=0;
---
<figure class="memory-figure" data-memory-replay>
 <div class="figure-heading"><span class="figure-number">Figure 4</span>Which answer keeps its place?</div>
 <div class="scene">
  <div class="options">
   <label>Rule <select data-policy>{Object.entries(policies).map(([value,label])=><option value={value}>{label}</option>)}</select></label>
   <label>Budget <select data-capacity><option value="2">2 KiB</option><option value="3" selected>3 KiB</option><option value="5">5 KiB</option><option value="8">8 KiB</option></select></label>
   <label>Largest entry <select data-max-entry><option value="3">3 KiB</option><option value="1">1 KiB</option></select></label>
  </div>
  <div class="stats"><span><strong data-hits data-live>0</strong> hits</span><span><strong data-reads data-live>0</strong> source reads</span><span><strong data-saved data-live>0</strong> work saved</span></div>
  <div class="whole-trace">{phases.map(phase=>{const start=offset;offset+=phase.ids.length;return <div class="phase"><small>{phase.name}</small><div class="request-row">{phase.ids.map((id,index)=><span class="request" data-request={start+index+1}><small>{start+index+1}</small> {id}</span>)}</div></div>;})}</div>
  <p><strong data-current data-live>Before the first request</strong></p>
  <div class="cache-boundary"><div class="budget-label"><strong>Resident entries</strong><span data-occupancy data-live>0 / 3 KiB</span></div><div class="residents" data-residents data-live><div class="resident empty">Empty</div></div></div>
  <p class="resident-history" data-history data-live>No resident history.</p>
  <div class="source box" data-source-panel><strong>Authoritative source</strong><span data-source data-live>No read yet.</span></div>
  <p class="callout" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">The cache is empty. Each miss reads the source; the selected admission rule decides whether to keep the answer.</p>
  <p class="counts" data-counts data-live>0 evictions · 0 skipped fills</p>
 </div>
 <div class="controls"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 19</span><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div>
 <figcaption>One invented trace, replayed from empty for every option. Product cards cost 1 KiB each; Q is a 3 KiB catalogue-list result. A miss costs two source-work units, except P9 (12) and Q (20). All fills complete before the next request. No expiry, updates, failures or concurrency occur. These charged entry sizes include the model’s overhead; they are not Redis measurements. Card widths follow their charged bytes within the selected budget.</figcaption>
 <details><summary>Rules and default trace, as text</summary><p>LRU removes the resident whose most recent access is oldest. LFU counts uses since admission, including the fill, and removes the lowest count; ties use LRU. Counts never decay in this model. Second request admits only a key seen in the preceding eight requests, then uses LRU. The eight-request history costs memory outside the illustrated entry budget. An answer exceeding either size limit is returned without being stored.</p><ol>{defaults.slice(1).map(step=><li>{step.text} Residents: {step.residents.map(item=>item.id).join(', ') || 'empty'}. Hits: {step.hits}; source reads: {step.reads}.</li>)}</ol></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 import {replay} from './model.mjs';
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-memory-replay]').forEach(root=>{
  const policy=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-policy]')!;
  const capacity=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-capacity]')!;
  const maxEntry=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-max-entry]')!;
  const deck=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-residents]')!;
  const set=(selector:string,value:string|number)=>{root.querySelector(selector)!.textContent=String(value);};
  let run=replay();
  const reduce=()=>window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>run.length,draw:(index:number)=>{
   const state=run[index],n=Number(capacity.value);
   set('[data-hits]',state.hits);set('[data-reads]',state.reads);set('[data-saved]',state.saved);
   set('[data-current]',state.request?`Request ${state.request.number}: ${state.request.id} · ${state.hit?'hit':'miss'}`:'Before the first request');
   set('[data-occupancy]',`${state.used} / ${n} KiB`);
   set('[data-source]',!state.request?'No read yet.':state.hit?`No source call for ${state.request.id}.`:`Return ${state.request.id} · ${state.request.cost} work units.`);
   set('[data-counts]',`${state.evictions} evictions · ${state.skipped} skipped fills`);
   set('[data-history]',state.residents.length?state.residents.map(item=>`${item.id}: ${item.count} use${item.count===1?'':'s'}, last #${item.last}`).join(' · '):'No resident history.');
   set('[data-explanation]',state.text);
   root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-request]').forEach(chip=>{
    const number=Number(chip.dataset.request);chip.classList.toggle('active',number===index);chip.classList.toggle('done',number<index);
    if(number===index)chip.setAttribute('aria-current','step');else chip.removeAttribute('aria-current');
   });
   const old=new Map([...deck.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-resident]')].map(el=>[el.dataset.resident!,{el,rect:el.getBoundingClientRect()}]));
   deck.querySelectorAll('.empty').forEach(el=>el.remove());
   for(const [id,{el,rect}] of old){if(!state.residents.some(item=>item.id===id)){
    if(!reduce()) {const ghost=el.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;ghost.removeAttribute('data-resident');ghost.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');ghost.classList.add('departing');const box=deck.getBoundingClientRect();Object.assign(ghost.style,{left:`${rect.left-box.left}px`,top:`${rect.top-box.top}px`,width:`${rect.width}px`,height:`${rect.height}px`});deck.append(ghost);ghost.animate([{transform:'translateY(0)',opacity:1},{transform:'translateY(28px)',opacity:0}],{duration:450,easing:'ease-in'}).finished.then(()=>ghost.remove()).catch(()=>ghost.remove());}
    el.remove();
   }}
   state.residents.forEach(item=>{
    const prior=old.get(item.id);const card=prior?.el||document.createElement('div');card.className='resident';card.dataset.resident=item.id;
    card.style.flex=`0 0 calc(${item.size/n*100}% - .4rem)`;
    card.replaceChildren();const name=document.createElement('strong');name.textContent=item.id;const history=document.createElement('small');history.textContent=`${item.size} KiB`;card.append(name,history);deck.append(card);
    if(!reduce()){if(!prior)card.animate([{transform:'translateY(35px)',opacity:0},{transform:'translateY(0)',opacity:1}],{duration:550,easing:'ease-out'});else{const rect=card.getBoundingClientRect();const dx=prior.rect.left-rect.left,dy=prior.rect.top-rect.top;if(dx||dy)card.animate([{transform:`translate(${dx}px,${dy}px)`},{transform:'translate(0,0)'}],{duration:450,easing:'ease-out'});if(state.hit&&item.id===state.request?.id)card.animate([{outline:'3px solid var(--color-accent)',outlineOffset:'0px'},{outline:'0px solid var(--color-accent)',outlineOffset:'8px'}],{duration:650});}}
   });
   if(!state.residents.length){const empty=document.createElement('div');empty.className='resident empty';empty.textContent='Empty';deck.append(empty);}
  }});
  for(const choice of [policy,capacity,maxEntry])choice.addEventListener('change',()=>{run=replay({policy:policy.value,capacity:Number(capacity.value),maxEntry:Number(maxEntry.value)});player.render();});
 });
</script>
<style>
 .whole-trace { margin:1rem 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.35rem 1rem; }.phase>small { color:var(--color-text-secondary); }.request small { font-size:.65rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
 .cache-boundary { border:1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);padding:.7rem; }.budget-label { display:flex;gap:.5rem;justify-content:space-between; }.residents { position:relative;min-height:6rem;align-items:stretch;gap:.4rem; }.resident { box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:anywhere; }.resident small { font-size:.75rem; }.resident-history { font-size:.8rem; }.resident.departing { position:absolute;pointer-events:none;z-index:1; }.source { margin-top:.7rem; }.counts { color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.8rem; }
 @media(max-width:540px){.whole-trace{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.resident{padding:.4rem .25rem;font-size:.75rem;}.resident small{font-size:.75rem;}.cache-boundary{padding:.45rem;}}
</style>
